# ── Supabase ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Found in your Supabase project: Project Settings → API.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in real values.

# Public anon key — safe for the browser, protected by RLS policies.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# ── Demo mode (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When the two variables above are absent, LockFlow runs in demo mode: a mock
# in-memory session so the shell can be explored without a Supabase project.
# Demo mode is a development convenience; never rely on it for real data.
